r-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o 4\u00ba Duatlo \u00cdlhavo 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com partida \u00e0s 10h00 no Jardim Henriqueta Maia, em \u00cdlhavo, distrito de Aveiro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a estrutura dos segmentos e dist\u00e2ncias do duatlo?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O formato sprint \u00e9 composto por 5 km de corrida inicial (2 voltas), 20 km de ciclismo de estrada (3 voltas) e 2,5 km de corrida final (1 volta).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">\u00c9 poss\u00edvel participar em equipa no Duatlo de \u00cdlhavo?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, al\u00e9m da vertente individual (Solos), a competi\u00e7\u00e3o inclui categorias espec\u00edficas para Duplas Masculinas, Duplas Femininas e Duplas Mistas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais os servi\u00e7os de apoio dispon\u00edveis para os atletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disponibiliza controlo de tempos por chip da SincTime, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica e acesso a balne\u00e1rios com duches quentes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e at\u00e9 quando podem ser feitas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma da SincTime at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23h59 de 8 de novembro de 2026, com valores bonificados na primeira fase at\u00e9 1 de novembro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"4\u00ba Duatlo \u00cdlhavo 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Jardim Henriqueta Maia, \u00cdlhavo, Aveiro\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"\u00cdlhavo\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"ADI - Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva de \u00cdlhavo\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o 4\u00ba Duatlo \u00cdlhavo 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com partida \u00e0s 10h00 no Jardim Henriqueta Maia, em \u00cdlhavo, distrito de Aveiro.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a estrutura dos segmentos e dist\u00e2ncias do duatlo?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O formato sprint \u00e9 composto por 5 km de corrida inicial (2 voltas), 20 km de ciclismo de estrada (3 voltas) e 2,5 km de corrida final (1 volta).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"\u00c9 poss\u00edvel participar em equipa no Duatlo de \u00cdlhavo?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, al\u00e9m da vertente individual (Solos), a competi\u00e7\u00e3o inclui categorias espec\u00edficas para Duplas Masculinas, Duplas Femininas e Duplas Mistas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais os servi\u00e7os de apoio dispon\u00edveis para os atletas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento disponibiliza controlo de tempos por chip da SincTime, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica e acesso a balne\u00e1rios com duches quentes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e at\u00e9 quando podem ser feitas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma da SincTime at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23h59 de 8 de novembro de 2026, com valores bonificados na primeira fase at\u00e9 1 de novembro.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69573,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,1456],"event_type_2":[34,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-69251","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-ilhavo-aveiro","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-ironman-triatlo","event_type_2-aveiro","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-duatlo-ilhavo-2.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/69251","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=69251"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/69251\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":69574,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/69251\/revisions\/69574"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/69573"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=69251"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=69251"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddab